      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Combining like bases, \\[ \\frac{x^y y^x}{y^y x^x} =x^{y-x}y^{x-y} =\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{y-x}. \\]\n\nThus the correct answer is D.",
